=2 Walkthrough
* While on Corsair, head to the Shararat Teahouse in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} at (K-12) for a cutscene and the key item, {k:Life float}.
** **Note**: After receiving the cutscene, you may commission Corsair Artifact Armor from {q:Leleroon|Leleroon|Leleroon}.
*** You may chose the order in which you receive the armor and may commission a new piece one Vana'diel day (one Earth hour) after the last piece was completed.
** The rest of this quest may be completed on any job.
** If you lose the battle, you may return to get another key item after one real life day (midnight JST).
* Head to the {z:The Ashu Talif} in {z:Arrapago Reef} through the Dvucca Isle Staging Point or {z:Alzadaal Undersea Ruins}.
** Option A:
*** To access the Cutter, first travel to {z:Dvucca Isle Staging Point} and leave the staging point putting you in Caedarva Mire (Map 2).
*** Head West to (F-9) and zone into {z:Arrapago Reef} through entrance 3.
*** Head North to (H-8) to find the Cutter.
** Option B:
*** The {p:Survival Guide} in {z:Caedarva Mire} is also close: From the Guide, head out of the tunnel to the West, then South to enter {z:Arrapago Reef} right beside the Ashu Talif.
** Option C:
*** The {i:Arrapago Ring|Arrapago Ring|26235}, purchased with 100 {p:Imperial standing accolades}, will teleport you in front of the Cutter.
* Approach the **Cutter** for a cutscene.
* Examine the **Cutter** to enter a battlefield against {n:Yazquhl} and {n:Gowam}.
** Up to six people may enter the fight.
** There is no level cap, and buffs will wear on entry.
** {p:Trusts|Trust} can be summoned in this fight.
* You will receive your reward immediately following the cutscene after the fight.

