=2 Walkthrough
Once you are eligible, Leleroon will ask which piece of armor you want to wear. Choose the piece you want first, and he will give you the appropriate letter {p:Key Item}:
* {k:Leleroon's letter (green)} (Hands)
** Visit {z:Windurst Waters} (HP #3) and speak to Zhuk Vojahom by examining the **Door: House** on the southern map at (E-7, NW corner)(It's D-7 until you actually touch the door). Provide her with the four materials listed above first, then trade the correct amount of coins. **__Note:** You will not find her out and about, you must examine the door to get the CS (you also trade the items to the door)__
* {k:Leleroon's letter (blue)} (Feet)
** Visit {z:Bastok Mines} (HP #1) and speak to Watzahl by examining the **Door: House** at the center left of (I-7), on the top floor, at the dead end of the walk bridge. Provide him with the four materials listed above first, then trade the correct amount of coins. **__Note:** You will not find him out and about, you must examine the door to get the CS (you also trade the items to the door)__
* {k:Leleroon's letter (red)} (Body)
** Visit {z:Port San d'Oria} (HP #1) and speak to {n:Raqtibahl} in the Rusty Anchor Pub. Provide him with the four materials listed above first, then trade the correct amount of coins.

\**NOTE:** You must wait one game day and change zones before you are given your finished piece of armor.
